From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:01:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: spi: apple,qspi: add T8122 and T8132

spi-apple-qspi already matches apple,t8122-qspi and apple,t8132-qspi
(apple_qspi_of_match), but the binding only admits apple,t8140-qspi, so a
T8132 qspi node fails dtbs_check. List the two compatibles the driver
binds, as Aurora integration/aurora does in its oneOf enum (SOURCE
28f3c297a1 and earlier); the T6030/T6031/T6050/T8152 fallbacks there have
no driver match in this tree and are left out.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,qspi.yaml | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,qspi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,qspi.yaml
index 4d33549e7b..39924afc9a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,qspi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,qspi.yaml
@@ -19,7 +19,10 @@ allOf:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8140-qspi
+    enum:
+      - apple,t8122-qspi
+      - apple,t8132-qspi
+      - apple,t8140-qspi
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
